SelectionHandles: the magnifier follows a dragged handle

It was placed when a handle was pressed and then stayed there (in Qt 4 too). Now it moves with
the finger, as the magnifier of a long press in the field does.

diff --git a/src/meego/SelectionHandles.qml b/src/meego/SelectionHandles.qml
--- a/src/meego/SelectionHandles.qml	2026-09-26 18:04:00
+++ b/src/meego/SelectionHandles.qml	2026-09-26 18:04:00
@@ -103,6 +103,8 @@
                       }
                       textInput.select(h,pos); // Select by character
                       privateIgnoreClose = false;
+                      // qt5-harmattan: the magnifier follows the finger, as the field's own does
+                      rect.updateMagnifierPosition(parent, mouse.x, mouse.y)
                   }
                   onReleased: {
                       Popup.enableOffset( false );
